L-4(b) + L-7 + L-8(e) (v0.19.1). Three additions to 'Known Limitations'
in both READMEs:
16. H8 (geometry) is not represented in the 7-bit mask — geometry
    findings are confirmed through the lane's own receipt, not through
    mask/h_states/evidence (the mask 8-bit widening itself stays a
    contract-v2 cross-series task: tray consumes the mask literally at
    two places and the null-observation literal would change with it).
17. The measured pypdf band: 6.6.0 drifts the pdf_images count pin
    (4 != 3, fixture-side), 6.21.4 is all green — the CI pin stays open
    in the ledger (floor maintained; measured band documented instead).
18. CSV/Excel inputs are not supported (roadmap candidate — needs a
    column-role specification first).
---
 README.ja.md | 14 ++++++++++++++
 README.md    | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+)

diff --git a/README.ja.md b/README.ja.md
index 4c2a084..fcd0fcf 100644
--- a/README.ja.md
+++ b/README.ja.md
@@ -356,6 +356,20 @@ Sieve シリーズの JSON ゲートはすべて、宣言済みの単一契約
    してあるため、どのパートが拒否を引き起こしたかを特定するには、他の
    道具でファイルを再調査する必要があります。
 
+16. **H8（幾何）は 7 ビット mask の外。** mask は `H1H2H3H4-H5H6H7` のまま
+   で、幾何レーンの所見が運ばれることはありません。幾何の所見はレーン自身の
+   レシート（`audit_geometry` / `audit_pdf_geometry`）で確認するもので、
+   mask・h_states・evidence には出ません。
+
+17. **pypdf の版で pdf_images pins が動く。** 実測バンド: pypdf 6.6.0 では
+   `TestPdfImagesFormInlinePins` の計数 pin がずれ（4 != 3 — fixture 側の
+   計数でライブラリの不具合ではない）、pypdf 6.21.4 では全スイートが緑。
+   CI の pypdf pin は台帳に open として残します。
+
+18. **CSV/Excel 入力は非対応**（ロードマップ候補）。エンジンが読むのは
+   `.txt`/`.md`/`.html`/`.htm`/`.docx` と任意の PDF・画像拡張で、列指向
+   形式は列の役割の仕様を固めてから観測対象になります。
+
 ---
 
 ## 📄 ライセンス
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index e4b2305..4b08292 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -376,6 +376,23 @@ domain of **machine-readable vs. human-visible divergence**.
    the code only — so identifying which part triggered a refusal
    requires re-examining the file with other tooling.
 
+16. **H8 (geometry) is outside the 7-bit mask.** The mask stays
+   `H1H2H3H4-H5H6H7` and never carries the geometry lane's findings;
+   they are confirmed through the lane's own receipt
+   (`audit_geometry` / `audit_pdf_geometry`), not through
+   mask/h_states/evidence.
+
+17. **pypdf versions drift in the pdf_images pins.** Measured band:
+   with pypdf 6.6.0 the `TestPdfImagesFormInlinePins` count pin drifts
+   (4 != 3 — fixture-side counting, not a library defect); with pypdf
+   6.21.4 the whole suite is green. The CI pypdf pin stays open in the
+   ledger.
+
+18. **CSV/Excel inputs are not supported** (roadmap candidate). The
+   engine reads `.txt`/`.md`/`.html`/`.htm`/`.docx` plus the optional
+   PDF/image extensions; column-oriented formats need a column-role
+   specification to be settled before they can be observed.
+
 ---
 
